---
import Logo from "./Logo.astro";
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="who">
      <a class="brand" href="/"><Logo size={22} /> Tupa's Trading Terminal</a>
      <p class="muted">A public research journal. CL1! crude oil futures, 1-minute bars.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fine">
      <p><strong>Not financial advice.</strong> Everything here is backtest research on past data. Results are
      in-sample unless a page says otherwise, and many were picked as the best of many tries, which makes them look
      better than what the same rules can be expected to earn. Charts that teach a strategy use illustrative prices,
      not real market data. Past results do not predict future results.</p>
      <p><a href="/about/#disclaimer">Full disclaimer</a> · <a href="/method/how-to-read/">How to read the results</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-raise);
    padding: 3rem 0 3.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr);
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .fine {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  .fine strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 550;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
